--
-- NOT INCLUDED: record-processes, ml-training-pipelines, ml-models and ml-model-scoring-bindings
-- (pushed with --exclude). The record process ships Active with a monthly schedule, and the
-- models carry no artifact, so on any other host every scheduled run would fail every contract
-- (MemberJunction/MJ#4829). bizapps-accounting leaves the same folders out of its Metadata_Sync
-- for the same reason. Whether this app ships them is tracked separately.
